[I] ROC profiler librar with perf-counters and derived metrics

[T] ROCProfiler is AMD’s tooling infrastructure that provides a hardware
[T] specific low level performance analysis interface for the profiling and the
[T] tracing of GPU compute applications.

[U] https://github.com/ROCm/rocprofiler

[A] Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[F] CROSS OBJDIR
[C] extra/development

[L] MIT
[V] 7.14.0
[P] X -----5---9 500.000

[CV-GROUP] rocm
[D] 9caf207557f2387946a6af566f6a12004c01ab97ccb1a91bf96aa466 rocm-systems-7.14.0.tar.gz https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-systems/archive/therock-7.14/
[D] 2d461ca4f5ae28cc3f53350a1b36771b5fcb95715c14382e842c0f7f perfetto-eb5ef24.tar.gz !https://github.com/google/perfetto/archive/eb5ef24c58d13cec289d733d03f0f3f0ed321b12.tar.gz

rocm_project=rocprofiler
. $base/package/*/*/rocm-conf.in
var_append cmakeopt ' ' "-DROCPROFILER_BUILD_TESTS=OFF -DROCPROFILER_BUILD_CI=OFF -DROCPROFILER_BUILD_SAMPLES=OFF"

# the perfetto plugin needs the perfetto git submodule, not in the archive
hook_add prepatch 5 'tar $taropt $(match_source_file -p perfetto-) --strip-components=1 -C projects/rocprofiler/plugin/perfetto/perfetto'
